<title>JAMAICA: CRICKET-RED STRIPE RESULTS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-RED STRIPE RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>KINGSTON 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of four-day Red Stripe</p>
<p>Cup matches ending on Monday:</p>
<p>At Kingstown, St Vincent:</p>
<p>Leeward Islands beat Windward Islands by six wickets.</p>
<p>Leeward Islands 390 and 107-4 (R.Jacobs 56 not out), Windward</p>
<p>Islands 158 and 337 (K.Martin 65, B.Watt 64). Leewards 16</p>
<p>points, Windwards 0.</p>
<p>At Port of Spain, Trinidad:</p>
<p>Trinidad and Tobago v Barbados - match drawn. Barbados 394</p>
<p>and 288 (W.Reid 54 not out; I.Bishop 4-94), Trinidad and Tobago</p>
<p>361 and 99-1 (S.Ragoonath 73). Barbados 8 points, Trinidad and</p>
<p>Tobago 4.</p>
<p>At Kingston:</p>
<p>Jamaica v Guyana - match drawn. Jamaica 206 and 251</p>
<p>(D.Morgan 51), Guyana 271 and 116-1 (S.Chanderpaul 56 not out).</p>
<p>Guyana 8 points, Jamaica 4.</p>
</text>
